==Equipment==
The Maggot King is weakest to crush and heavy ranged attacks. Although it possesses a relatively high Magic level and defence (200 Magic and +150 magic defence), it also possesses an 80% susceptibility to [[fire spells]], which can be feasible for maging players utilising a [[harmonised Nightmare staff]], [[tome of fire]] and [[confliction gauntlets]]. Furthermore, successful attacks with fire spells deal an additional (stacking) 5 [[burn]] damage to the boss. It is recommended to use fire spells with either the harmonised Nightmare staff or the [[twinflame staff]], as not only does the boss's magic defence get reduced by 20 per burn stack, but failed casts will also benefit from confliction gauntlets, whereas [[Tumeken's shadow]] gains none of these benefits. The harmonised nightmare and twinflame staffs also output fire hits at a higher rate than standard autocast staffs such as the [[Purging staff]], ensuring the boss gets to full burn stacks more quickly and stays there more reliably. 

Perfect kills will require minimal sustain, as the boss deals very little chip damage when walking onto acid/bile pools and being hit by small carrion bits. While not necessary, an [[amulet of blood fury]] switch can also be used to heal off of any damage taken during the fight. The boss frequently drops a [[dull ancient medal]] and 2-4 [[stymphike tartare]]s, which help restore prayer, has a 3/7 chance to provide combat stats and heal a good amount of health, which often adds an extra kill into trips.

<tabber>
Magic=

Fire spells are especially powerful, causing both a damage-over-time effect and lowering the boss's magic defence. Generally, [[fire surge]] with a [[tome of fire]] and [[sunfire rune]]s or [[searing pages]] will outperform the [[Tumeken's shadow]]. This is much more beneficial than thralls and Death Charge, as the only special attack needed is the [[Eye of Ayak]] to lower the boss's magic defence, which costs 50% energy and is easily restored over the course of a single kill. Apply the ayak special when the boss has 5 burn stacks.

