Ranged= 

Heavy ranged options, which require bolts, are the most effective ranged weapons to use on the Maggot King. While cheaper than magic, players will usually have longer kills and shorter trips as damage leading up to the melee phase is heavily reliant on enchanted ruby bolts, which forces the player to keep health low to avoid as much self-damage as possible. Additionally, a standard ranged weapon is required to deal with ur-maggots. [[Dizana's quiver]] allows bringing both ammo types without using extra switches or inventory slots but caution is advised if the player brings a melee cape switch, as failing to switch back to quiver can result in failing to fire. A charged bow such as a [[bow of Faerdhinen (c)]], [[crystal bow]] or [[webweaver bow]] is a good way to get around this problem while also providing a nine to ten tile range to hit larvae. A [[venator bow]] is another option for killing larvae as the shots can bounce to the boss for extra damage, and also bounce to other larvae spawns to kill multiple in 1 click. It does have slightly less range than other bow options however so take care to not be dragged into hazards. 

