==Plugins==
* Better NPC Highlight
** For true tile highlighting the boss, add <code>Maggot King</code> to "True Tile" -> "True Tile Names".
** For ur-maggot larvae, add <code>Ur-maggot*</code> to "Clickbox" -> "Clickbox Names".
* Custom Menu Swaps
** To have ur-maggot larvae attack options appear on top of anything else, add <code>Attack,Ur-maggot*</code> to "Custom Swaps"
*Maggot King
**Hides carrion and trees for visibility.
**Can also be used to highlight the boss and larvae instead of Better NPC Highlight.

